  "description": "Three dates to save the bookstore?!\nBanished from the celestial realm for interfering in the fate of a mortal, Ju-Hee now lives a mortal life herself as the owner of a bookstore. When she suddenly receives an eviction notice, she visits her landlord to plead her case. But what will she do when he makes her a peculiar offer? \n\n(Source: Manta)",
